{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight through unyielding hordes of ancient Nordic undeads. Set during WW2, you and up to <i><strong>3 other survivors</strong></i> must hold the line against the <strong>Draugar.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Draugar</strong> is a wave-based, first-person shooter. You start off with a basic pistol, and you must fight your way through the rounds to acquire cash. Use the cash you earn to buy firearms, grenades and various upgrades (such as a faster fire rate, more health and higher ammunition capacity) to give you the edge over the undeads.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/fc732139f442407aae8a2f8338085940.poster.avif?t=1752378552\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/fc732139f442407aae8a2f8338085940.webm?t=1752378552\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/fc732139f442407aae8a2f8338085940.mp4?t=1752378552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game ships with 3 different playable locations:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>1. Testing Facility </strong>(Indoor facility with a trampoline)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>2. Dreadmill Farm </strong>(Confined outdoor space with a big farmhouse and plenty of corn)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>3. Blodhavn </strong>(A small-ish  rural church town)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to play some casual first person shoot-em-up game with your friends, <strong>Draugar</strong> might just be what you're looking for!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832240?t=1752378552","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/25f99669a9aada9e608ef6e682d1f2db756a2a7d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752378552","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/24aa9dc3b718e46b1b931bd3593624fdb26d9140/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752378552","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/24aa9dc3b718e46b1b931bd3593624fdb26d9140/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752378552","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight through unyielding hordes of ancient Nordic undeads. Set during WW2, you and up to <i><strong>3 other survivors</strong></i> must hold the line against the <strong>Draugar.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Draugar</strong> is a wave-based, first-person shooter. You start off with a basic pistol, and you must fight your way through the rounds to acquire cash. Use the cash you earn to buy firearms, grenades and various upgrades (such as a faster fire rate, more health and higher ammunition capacity) to give you the edge over the undeads.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/fc732139f442407aae8a2f8338085940.poster.avif?t=1752378552\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/fc732139f442407aae8a2f8338085940.webm?t=1752378552\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/extras/fc732139f442407aae8a2f8338085940.mp4?t=1752378552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game ships with 3 different playable locations:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>1. Testing Facility </strong>(Indoor facility with a trampoline)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>2. Dreadmill Farm </strong>(Confined outdoor space with a big farmhouse and plenty of corn)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>3. Blodhavn </strong>(A small-ish  rural church town)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to play some casual first person shoot-em-up game with your friends, <strong>Draugar</strong> might just be what you're looking for!</p>","developers":["Thule Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832240/57943d106ea19a6465c3cf80d7450737b9868e82/header.jpg?t=1752378552","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257168284,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168284/movie480.mp4?t=1752378550","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168284/movie_max.mp4?t=1752378550"},"name":"Draugar Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257168284/a3759e687386ea82e9cba3bfef857c7cec32c1b2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752378550","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168284/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752378550","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168284/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752378550"}}],"name":"Draugar","package_g